{"id": "31608", "title": "西厢记", "author": "王实甫", "category": "文学名著", "count": 26, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/31/31608.htm", "intro": "《西厢记》全名《崔莺莺待月西厢记》。作者王实甫，元代著名杂剧作家，大都（今北京市）人。他一生写作了14种剧本，《西厢记》大约写于元贞、大德年间（1295～1307）是他的代表作。这个剧一上舞台就惊倒四座，博得男女青年的喜爱，被誉为“西厢记天下夺魁”。\r\n　　历史上，“愿普天下有情人都成眷属”这一美好的愿望，不知成为多少文学作品的主题，《西厢记》便是描绘这一主题的最成功的戏剧。", "base": "files/article/html/31/31608", "chapters": [{"title": "楔子", "file": "2043154.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第一本：张君瑞闹道场杂剧", "volume": true}, {"title": "第一折", "file": "2043155.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二折", "file": "2043156.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第三折", "file": "2043157.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第四折", "file": "2043158.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二本：崔莺莺夜听琴杂剧", "volume": true}, {"title": "第一折", "file": "2043159.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二折", "file": "2043160.html", "available": false}, {"title": "楔子", "file": "2043161.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第三折", "file": "2043162.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第四折", "file": "2043163.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第五折", "file": "2043164.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第三本：张君瑞害相思杂剧", "volume": true}, {"title": "楔子", "file": "2043165.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第一折", "file": "2043166.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二折", "file": "2043167.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第三折", "file": "2043168.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第四折", "file": "2043169.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第四折", "file": "2043179.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第四本：草桥店梦莺莺杂剧", "volume": true}, {"title": "楔子", "file": "2043170.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第一折", "file": "2043171.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二折", "file": "2043172.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第三折", "file": "2043173.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第四折", "file": "2043174.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第五本：张君瑞庆团圆杂剧", "volume": tru